        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stainless Steel Studio Leverset AHI SIG121-204</b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe AHI SIG121-204 has a square rose, and a flat block style straight grip.  This is a block style, almost \"cubism\" in appearance, and gives a unique and blending accent to any home with modern decor. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe lever is all stainless steel, making it extremely resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasions. It will not degrade in appearance or function even after many years of use on your home or office. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis style lever is also available with a round rose, <a href=\"/products/stainless-steel-harmony-leverset-ahi-sig121\">AHI SIG121</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features of AHI SIG121-204 Stainless Steel Leversets:</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Width: 4.72\" (120mm)</li>\r\n<li>Grip Thickness: 0.31\" (8mm)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1.73\" (44mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose: 2-1/2\" (63mm) square</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Residential and Commercial Doors</li>\r\n<li>Field reversible tubular latch</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable for door thickness of 1-3/8\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" Pre-Drilled Doors)</li>\r\n<li>All Levers meet <a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">Americans with Disabilities Act (ADA)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When choosing a function:</b>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Single Dummy: For use as a pull or to match trim.</li>\r\n<li>Double Dummy: Stationary both sides of door</li>\r\n<li>Passage (Hall or Closet): For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom): For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<br>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Stainless Steel Studio Leverset AHI SIG121-204",
                "description": "Studio AHI Stainless Steel Leverset SIG121-204 - Modern Square Rose Stainless Door Levers. AHI Stainless Steel Leverset SIG121-204 Adjustable Door thickness 1 3/8 to 2 inch. Fits standard door cut outs\r\n",
